"use client"; import { useState } from "react"; const regions=['Global','Asia','Europe','North America','South America','Africa','Oceania']; export function RegionLobbySelector(){const[r,setR]=useState('Global'); return <div className="flex flex-wrap gap-2">{regions.map(x=><button key={x} onClick={()=>setR(x)} className={`rounded-full border-2 border-[#020202] px-4 py-2 ${r===x?'bg-[#bc352a] text-white':'bg-white'}`}>{x}</button>)}</div>}
